  "historyNote": "#2344, eff 4-15-83; ss by #2986, eff 3-18-85; ss by #4357, eff 1-20-88, EXPIRED: 1-20-94 New. #6516, eff 5-24-97, EXPIRED: 5-24-05 New. #9387, eff 2-12-09 (from Frl 403.02); ss by #12129, eff 3-10-17; ss by #14645, eff 9-7-26, EXPIRES: 9-7-36",
